 itself:\n\n$$\n{(\\frac{1}{9})}^{2}=\\frac{1}{9}\\cdot \\frac{1}{9}=\\frac{1}{81}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-695816b9-028c-5cdf-b7e1-17fd412268d1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-695816b9-028c-5cdf-b7e1-17fd412268d1" :answer-field/id #uuid "695816b9-028c-5cdf-b7e1-17fd412268d1" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-ffd5b701-3c55-5a13-9705-5e37e7b904b8" :answer-field/choices ["answer-6431f8e0-22c1-5a92-b706-ab325a5dfa0d" "answer-274904f4-58f7-56e2-9b6d-31c1ae57ce78" "answer-ffd5b701-3c55-5a13-9705-5e37e7b904b8" "answer-8776b217-a7c6-5847-98f1-2b8609aea8cd" "answer-a6f1ac2b-edcc-5f11-8220-b6a757312e57"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-6431f8e0-22c1-5a92-b706-ab325a5dfa0d" :answer/id #uuid "6431f8e0-22c1-5a92-b706-ab325a5dfa0d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{18}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-274904f4-58f7-56e2-9b6d-31c1ae57ce78" :answer/id #uuid "274904f4-58f7-56e2-9b6d-31c1ae57ce78" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{49}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-ffd5b701-3c55-5a13-9705-5e37e7b904b8" :answer/id #uuid "ffd5b701-3c55-5a13-9705-5e37e7b904b8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{81}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-8776b217-a7c6-5847-98f1-2b8609aea8cd" :answer/id #uuid "8776b217-a7c6-5847-98f1-2b8609aea8cd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{90}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-a6f1ac2b-edcc-5f11-8220-b6a757312e57" :answer/id #uuid "a6f1ac2b-edcc-5f11-8220-b6a757312e57" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{2}{9}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186133736 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-3cfc1cc8-75ac-58cb-baba-115d9b2db8af"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-3cfc1cc8-75ac-58cb-baba-115d9b2db8af" :question/id #uuid "3cfc1cc8-75ac-58cb-baba-115d9b2db8af" :question/math-academy-id "q-185181" :question/problem "Expressed as an improper fraction or mixed number, ${(-\\frac{8}{5})}^{2}=${{field-1}}." :question/worked-solution "To work out ${(-\\frac{8}{5})}^{2},$ we multiply $-\\frac{8}{5}$ by itself:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{(-\\frac{8}{5})}^{2} & = \\\\ (-\\frac{8}{5})\\cdot (-\\frac{8}{5}) & = \\\\ \\frac{8\\cdot 8}{5\\cdot 5} & = \\\\ \\frac{64}{25} & \\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-dfa2a1c0-d3ce-5d21-872c-ede324a37869"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-dfa2a1c0-d3ce-5d21-872c-ede324a37869" :answer-field/id #uuid "dfa2a1c0-d3ce-5d21-872c-ede324a37869" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-cb37b488-9bf2-5a55-9b98-ff72718291b6" :answer-field/choices ["answer-cb37b488-9bf2-5a55-9b98-ff72718291b6"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-cb37b488-9bf2-5a55-9b98-ff72718291b6" :answer/id #uuid "cb37b488-9bf2-5a55-9b98-ff72718291b6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{64}{25}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-056f7c20-573d-55c9-bb54-7bee0a1479fd" :question/id #uuid "056f7c20-573d-55c9-bb54-7bee0a1479fd" :question/math-academy-id "q-185189" :question/problem "Expressed as an improper fraction or mixed number, ${(\\frac{5}{3})}^{2}=${{field-1}}." :question/worked-solution "To work out ${(\\frac{5}{3})}^{2},$ we multiply $\\frac{5}{3}$ by itself:\n\n$$\n{(\\frac{5}{3})}^{2}=\\frac{5}{3}\\cdot \\frac{5}{3}=\\frac{25}{9}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-6d582431-5271-591c-a589-e2a2aea28272"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-6d582431-5271-591c-a589-e2a2aea28272" :answer-field/id #uuid "6d582431-5271-591c-a589-e2a2aea28272" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-540b5a5a-5141-58c1-9bbe-df63004cb07d" :answer-field/choices ["answer-540b5a5a-5141-58c1-9bbe-df63004cb07d"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-540b5a5a-5141-58c1-9bbe-df63004cb07d" :answer/id #uuid "540b5a5a-5141-58c1-9bbe-df63004cb07d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{25}{9}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-9362856b-6dfd-5551-b35f-afef6a56607c" :question/id #uuid "9362856b-6dfd-5551-b35f-afef6a56607c" :question/math-academy-id "q-185205" :question/problem "Expressed as a decimal in its simplest form, $(-4.5)^{2}=${{field-1}}." :question/worked-solution "We need to calculate the product of $(-4.5)$ with itself:\n\n$$\n(-4.5)^{2}=(-4.5)\\cdot (-4.5)=(4.5)\\cdot (4.5)\n$$\n\nFirst, we ignore the decimal points and multiply as if both numbers were whole numbers:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\begin{aligned} &  &  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\begin{aligned}\\boxed{2} \\\\ \\boxed{2}\\end{aligned}\\,\\,\\,\\, &  \\\\  &  &  & \\,\\,\\,\\,4\\,\\,\\,\\, & \\,\\,\\,\\,5\\,\\,\\,\\, \\\\ \\,\\,\\,\\,\\times \\,\\,\\,\\, & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\, & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\, & \\,\\,\\,\\,4\\,\\,\\,\\, & \\,\\,\\,\\,5\\,\\,\\,\\, \\\\  &  & \\,\\,\\,\\,2\\,\\,\\,\\, & \\,\\,\\,\\,2\\,\\,\\,\\, & \\,\\,\\,\\,5\\,\\,\\,\\, \\\\ \\,\\,\\,\\,+\\,\\,\\,\\, & \\,\\,\\,\\,1\\,\\,\\,\\, & \\,\\,\\,\\,8\\,\\,\\,\\, & \\,\\,\\,\\,0\\,\\,\\,\\, & \\,\\,\\,\\,0\\,\\,\\,\\, \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,2\\,\\,\\,\\, & \\,\\,\\,\\,0\\,\\,\\,\\, & \\,\\,\\,\\,2\\,\\,\\,\\, & \\,\\,\\,\\,5\\,\\,\\,\\,\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $45\\times 45=2\\,025.$\n\nWe now count the total number of decimal places in the two factors.\n\nThere is $1$ decimal place in the first factor ($4.5$) and $1$ decimal place in the second factor ($4.5$), so their product will have $1+1=2$ decimal places.\n\nWe take our value of $2\\,025$ and insert a decimal point to make a number with $2$ decimal places:\n\n$$\n20\\,\\overset{↓}{.}\\,\\,\\,{{25}_{⏟}}_{2\\text{ digits}}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $(-4.5)^{2}=20.25\\,.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-80f35c7a-0c9b-50f3-b115-b30ce556b18b"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-80f35c7a-0c9b-50f3-b115-b30ce556b18b" :answer-field/id #uuid "80f35c7a-0c9b-50f3-b115-b30ce556b18b" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-f2c06f3e-ac54-53ac-853c-0a9d19f1a9ad" :answer-field/choices ["answer-f2c06f3e-ac54-53ac-853c-0a9d19f1a9ad"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-f2c06f3e-ac54-53ac-853c-0a9d19f1a9ad" :answer/id #uuid "f2c06f3e-ac54-53ac-853c-0a9d19f1a9ad" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "20.25" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "activity-a5e6c4aa-e33a-5632-9ea3-6d08ffe1753f" :activity/id #uuid "a5e6c4aa-e33a-5632-9ea3-6d08ffe1753f" :activity/title "Squaring Rational Numbers" :activity/type :activity.type/review :activity/scope 17592186050428 :activity/course 17592186046647 :activity/steps ["step-d2bbd8f7-e12b-5835-805d-1d67c253c50f" "step-2a01f71d-97d1-5207-b8b2-d2e65ddf34ab" "step-2ca76ade-a0fe-5c1b-bf99-b23c6a48abbb" "step-a725bc28-e1db-5604-962d-8da46d9083f2" "step-f52bc408-bc3b-523d-a977-71987b08adcc"] :activity/first-step "step-d2bbd8f7-e12b-5835-805d-1d67c253c50f" :db/ensure [:activity/validate]} {:db/id "step-d2bbd8f7-e12b-5835-805d-1d67c253c50f" :step/id #uuid "d2bbd8f7-e12b-5835-805d-1d67c253c50f" :step/content "question-8c77c325-2e41-51df-821c-943abffd054d" :step/next "step-2a01f71d-97d1-5207-b8b2-d2e65ddf34ab" :db/ensure [:step/validate]} {:db/id "step-2a01f71d-97d1-5207-b8b2-d2e65ddf34ab" :step/id #uuid "2a01f71d-97d1-5207-b8b2-d2e65ddf34ab" :step/content "question-b06c7090-b9ea-594c-b431-3fe9296b347e" :step/next "step-2ca76ade-a0fe-5c1b-bf99-b23c6a48abbb" :db/ensure [:step/validate]} {:db/id "step-2ca76ade-a0fe-5c1b-bf99-b23c6a48abbb" :step/id #uuid "2ca76ade-a0fe-5c1b-bf99-