ctors.\n\nThere is $1$ decimal place in the first factor ($7.3$) and $1$ decimal place in the second factor ($7.3$), so their product will have $1+1=2$ decimal places.\n\nWe take our value of $5\\,329$ and insert a decimal point to make a number with $2$ decimal places:\n\n$$\n53\\,\\overset{↓}{.}\\,\\,\\,{{29}_{⏟}}_{2\\text{ digits}}\n$$\n\nTherefore, ${7.3}^{2}=53.29\\,.$"] ["question-8c77c325-2e41-51df-821c-943abffd054d" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] ["answer-field-5b277ddb-c4ed-5fd4-b2dc-c14fccceaffe" :answer-field/id #uuid "5b277ddb-c4ed-5fd4-b2dc-c14fccceaffe"] ["answer-dc6fe410-d7fb-5fa7-84e2-d245a133c254" :answer/id #uuid "dc6fe410-d7fb-5fa7-84e2-d245a133c254"] ["answer-dc6fe410-d7fb-5fa7-84e2-d245a133c254" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-dc6fe410-d7fb-5fa7-84e2-d245a133c254" :answer/value "14.29"] ["answer-2ff1f921-52e3-539a-b46b-8486b70c61bc" :answer/id #uuid "2ff1f921-52e3-539a-b46b-8486b70c61bc"] ["answer-2ff1f921-52e3-539a-b46b-8486b70c61bc" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-2ff1f921-52e3-539a-b46b-8486b70c61bc" :answer/value "49.29"] ["answer-4ef14f82-1314-55e0-aa7f-d6fa02048203" :answer/id #uuid "4ef14f82-1314-55e0-aa7f-d6fa02048203"] ["answer-4ef14f82-1314-55e0-aa7f-d6fa02048203" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-4ef14f82-1314-55e0-aa7f-d6fa02048203" :answer/value "53"] ["answer-fe7b2309-a94f-5c47-83f4-fd09d8bb04d5" :answer/id #uuid "fe7b2309-a94f-5c47-83f4-fd09d8bb04d5"] ["answer-fe7b2309-a94f-5c47-83f4-fd09d8bb04d5" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-fe7b2309-a94f-5c47-83f4-fd09d8bb04d5" :answer/value "53.29"] ["answer-9ce61d4c-674e-501c-94f8-21794f4cd123" :answer/id #uuid "9ce61d4c-674e-501c-94f8-21794f4cd123"] ["answer-9ce61d4c-674e-501c-94f8-21794f4cd123" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-9ce61d4c-674e-501c-94f8-21794f4cd123" :answer/value "53.9"] ["answer-field-5b277ddb-c4ed-5fd4-b2dc-c14fccceaffe" :answer-field/key "selection"] ["answer-field-5b277ddb-c4ed-5fd4-b2dc-c14fccceaffe" :answer-fi